# Features

- An invariant belongs in `.cursor/rules`. A feature belongs in `docs/features/<name>.md`.
- A feature is workflow: who does what, in what order, and what the screen must show.
- Write a feature document only after the user agrees to that workflow.
- Implement a feature only after the user approves that document.
- Code shape inside an approved feature is not a feature decision.
